      {
        "id": "rent-denominator",
        "afterParagraphId": "p-d9bb71ed-1283-4189-a501-85831daa3d8a",
        "title": "同样月租，150倍和200倍差在哪",
        "html": "<small>补充换算 · 不预设所谓国际统一标准</small><h3>把房价换成一叠月租</h3><div class=\"row\"><button id=\"m150\">150倍</button><button id=\"m200\">200倍</button><button id=\"m300\">300倍</button></div><svg class=\"visual\" viewBox=\"0 0 620 190\"></svg><output id=\"status\"></output><p class=\"note\">每小格代表10个月租金。倍数=P/月租；年毛收益率=12/倍数。150→200以150为基准是+33.3%；200→150是−25%，原文“30%”为约数，不静默改写。</p>",
        "js": "const __name=(fn)=>fn;\nconst q=__name(s=>document.querySelector(s),\"q\");function draw(m){q(\"svg\").innerHTML=Array.from({length:30},(_,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(10+i%10*60)+'\" y=\"'+(10+Math.floor(i/10)*52)+'\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" fill=\"'+(i<m/10?\"#377365\":\"#d6e2d9\")+'\"/>').join(\"\");q(\"#status\").textContent=m+\"\\u4E2A\\u6708\\u79DF\\u91D1\\u4E70\\u4E0B\\u623F\\u5B50 \\xB7 \\u5E74\\u6BDB\\u6536\\u76CA\\u7387 \"+(1200/m).toFixed(2)+\"%\"}__name(draw,\"draw\");[150,200,300].forEach(m=>q(\"#m\"+m).onclick=()=>draw(m));draw(200)",
        "css": "body{padding:16px;color:var(--ink,#183a35);background:var(--paper,#f2f5ed)}h3,p{margin:0 0 12px}h3{font-size:21px;line-height:1.25}small,.note{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted,#526b62)}.row{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0}button{border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;color:inherit;padding:8px 12px;min-height:42px}button[aria-pressed=true],button.primary{background:var(--ink,#183a35);color:var(--paper,#f2f5ed)}label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:12px;gap:4px;min-width:0}input[type=number],select{border:1px solid #9baaa2;background:#fff;color:#16332e;border-radius:4px;padding:8px;width:100%;min-width:0}input[type=range]{width:100%;accent-color:var(--ink,#183a35)}.controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.metrics{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;margin:14px 0}.metrics b{font-size:26px;line-height:1.2;display:block;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}.metrics span{font-size:12px}.visual{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}output{display:block}button:disabled{opacity:.35}svg text{font-family:inherit}.note{margin-top:12px}[hidden]{display:none!important}@media(max-width:420px){body{padding:12px}.controls{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.metrics b{font-size:23px}h3{font-size:19px}}body{--ink:#255747;--paper:#edf4eb}",
