      {
        "id": "rent-calendar",
        "afterParagraphId": "p-42247dd2-e87a-4d4b-826a-bc1b9176cc6a",
        "title": "十二张账单，哪些真的收到了",
        "html": "<small>作者案例：成交115万、月租11,200；税费原文“13,000多”，演示取13,000</small><h3>点月份设为空置，再看看年末剩下多少</h3><div class=\"controls\"><label>成交价 / 原文货币单位<input id=\"price\" type=\"number\" min=\"100000\" max=\"10000000\" value=\"1150000\"></label><label>月租<input id=\"rent\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100000\" value=\"11200\"></label><label>全年持有成本<input id=\"cost\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"1000000\" value=\"13000\"></label><label>租金下降 / %<input id=\"drop\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\"></label></div><div id=\"calendar\"></div><svg class=\"visual\" viewBox=\"0 0 620 180\"></svg><output id=\"status\"></output><output id=\"yield\"></output><div class=\"row\"><button id=\"down\">租金下跌10%</button><button id=\"empty\">全年空置</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复案例</button></div><p class=\"note\">净运营收入=实际月租×有租月份−全年成本。仅计填入费用，未计贷款、交易费与资本升值；不能用此简化值冒充作者称买家核算的7.5—8%。地区定价判断保留为作者观点。</p>",
        "js": "const __name=(fn)=>fn;\nconst q=__name(s=>document.querySelector(s),\"q\");let vacant=new Set;function number(k){const el=q(\"#\"+k),v=Math.max(+el.min,Math.min(+el.max,+el.value||0));el.value=v;return v}__name(number,\"number\");function draw(){const p=number(\"price\"),r=number(\"rent\")*(1-number(\"drop\")/100),c=number(\"cost\"),gross=r*12,collected=r*(12-vacant.size),net=collected-c,max=Math.max(1,gross,c,Math.abs(net));q(\"#calendar\").innerHTML=Array.from({length:12},(_,i)=>'<button data-month=\"'+i+'\" aria-pressed=\"'+vacant.has(i)+'\" class=\"'+(vacant.has(i)?\"vacant\":\"\")+'\">'+(i+1)+\"\\u6708<small>\"+(vacant.has(i)?\"\\u7A7A\\u7F6E\":r.toFixed(0))+\"</small></button>\").join(\"\");q(\"svg\").innerHTML=[[\"\\u6BDB\\u79DF\\u91D1\",gross,\"#a8bcb1\"],[\"\\u5B9E\\u6536\",collected,\"#568d76\"],[\"\\u6263\\u6210\\u672C\",-c,\"#bd855f\"],[\"\\u51C0\\u8FD0\\u8425\",net,net>=0?\"#255747\":\"#af574c\"]].map(([name,v,col],i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(25+i*150)+'\" y=\"'+(v>=0?100-v/max*70:100)+'\" width=\"90\" height=\"'+Math.abs(v)/max*70+'\" fill=\"'+col+'\"/><text x=\"'+(20+i*150)+'\" y=\"178\">'+name+\"</text>\").join(\"\")+'<path d=\"M10 100H610\" stroke=\"#809483\"/>';q(\"#status\").textContent=\"\\u51FA\\u79DF \"+(12-vacant.size)+\" \\u4E2A\\u6708 \\xB7 \\u5E74\\u51C0\\u8FD0\\u8425\\u6536\\u5165 \"+net.toFixed(2);q(\"#yield\").textContent=\"\\u5E74\\u6BDB\\u6536\\u76CA \"+(gross/p*100).toFixed(2)+\"% / \\u7B80\\u5316\\u51C0\\u6536\\u76CA \"+(net/p*100).toFixed(2)+\"%\"}__name(draw,\"draw\");q(\"#calendar\").onclick=e=>{const b=e.target.closest(\"[data-month]\");if(b){const n=+b.dataset.month;vacant.has(n)?vacant.delete(n):vacant.add(n);draw()}};[\"price\",\"rent\",\"cost\",\"drop\"].forEach(k=>q(\"#\"+k).oninput=draw);q(\"#down\").onclick=()=>{q(\"#drop\").value=10;draw()};q(\"#empty\").onclick=()=>{vacant=new Set(Array.from({length:12},(_,i)=>i));draw()};q(\"#reset\").onclick=()=>{vacant.clear();for(const[k,v]of Object.entries({price:115e4,rent:11200,cost:13e3,drop:0}))q(\"#\"+k).value=v;draw()};draw()",
